es himself in the forest. There, he stumbles upon a boy his own age. They don’t exchange names, and yet none of that seems to matter. With him, even nibbling on grass becomes an adventure. Ruan finds himself laughing, playing, and perhaps for the very first time, feeling free. Day by day, his thoughts drift further from the rigid lessons of succession and closer to the warmth of that kindhearted boy. But gossip spreads quickly, and soon even the stern Count Marcellion hears whispers of his son’s wandering heart… Could a simple forest friendship change the path of an heir?","year":2024,"status":"completed","lastChapter":"38","contentRating":"safe","tags":["Historical","Romance","Boys' Love","Drama","Slice of Life","Tragedy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/d0dde84d-4b60-42c9-8be8-5906343988cb/2fe7165f-79c7-47f1-8115-1694119bd609.png.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["fr","en"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":8.32,"follows":843,"listAt":"2026-10-25T12:58:17.624Z","chapters":[{"id":"71617a5b-358d-4ef2-9ffe-dd3198023f8a","number":"36","volume":null,"title":"Side Story 20","lang":"en","pages":28,"createdAt":"2025-07-22T01:12:54+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"705a89a8-ce87-4c0b-9758-e63aae4abc07","number":"35","volume":null,"title":"Side Story 19","lang":"en","pages":23,"createdAt":"2025-07-11T03:28:24+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"82d29e62-47d2-48ae-b0ec-64d15216e20a","number":"34","volume":null,"title":"Side Story 18","lang":"en","pages":23,"createdAt":"2025-07-03T04:17:51+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"ca9ae6d9-664c-43cd-9da8-2b20361790d2","number":"33","volume":null,"title":"Side Story 17","lang":"en","pages":26,"createdAt":"2025-07-01T03:41:39+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"987ff0a1-491e-4ee4-9323-e77b89354de4","number":"32","volume":null,"title":"Side Story 16","lang":"en","pages":23,"createdAt":"2025-06-24T02:52:31+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"c6ee6ab2-fd99-4aef-8d35-b3d607845767","number":"31","volume":null,"title":"Side Story 15","lang":"en",